title: Leadership Crisis
subtitle: The faction in the Zentrale no longer accepts the party's course.
new-page: true
tags: rf_event
view-if: rf_over = 0 and leader_dissent >= 70 and crisis_timer <= 0
on-arrival: crisis_timer = 4

= Leadership Crisis

The <span class="f-[+ leader +]">[+ leader_name +]</span> holds the Zentrale but has lost patience with the decisions you have pushed through. Its leaders threaten to resign and take the apparatus with them.

- @concede
- @replace

@concede
title: Give the leadership its way for now.
subtitle: Calms the leadership. Every other faction is irritated.
on-arrival: {!
Q[Q.leader + '_dissent'] -= 25;
Q[Q.leader + '_strength'] += 3;
for (var f of window.RF.factions) {
    if (f != Q.leader) { Q[f + '_dissent'] += 4; }
}
!}

The leadership stays, and the line bends its way.

@replace
title: Let the Central Committee choose a new leadership.
subtitle: The strongest faction, or Moscow's choice, takes over.
on-arrival: {!
var old = Q.leader;
Q.old_leader = old;
Q.old_leader_name = window.RF.names[old];
Q[old + '_dissent'] += 10;
Q.apparatus -= 5;
var best = null;
for (var f of window.RF.factions) {
    if (f == old || Q[f + '_expelled']) { continue; }
    if (best === null || Q[f + '_strength'] > Q[best + '_strength']) { best = f; }
}
Q.leader = best;
window.RF.verdict(Q);
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

The <span class="f-[+ old_leader +]">[+ old_leader_name +]</span> resigns from the Zentrale. [? if moscow_overruled : Moscow steps in and installs ?][? if moscow_overruled = 0 : The Central Committee elects ?] the <span class="f-[+ leader +]">[+ leader_name +]</span>.
